  "title": "Tortilla Chicken Vegetable Soup",
  "description": "Chopped peppers, cilantro, and corn are added to this chicken and rice soup that's seasoned with cumin and cayenne pepper. Serve with crushed tortilla chips and crumbled asadero or grated Monterey Jack cheese.",
  "authors": [
    "GARNIE"
